Subject: [PATCH] dvfel: convert Kodi GUI to a physical-grid TV-led overlay

Retain software PQ GUI/PGS conversion while native Dolby processing is off.
Scale GUI before carrier packing, submit physical-sized OSD buffers without
another plane scaler, and own premultiplied alpha for the carrier session.
Protect the picture's CCM pixels with transparent GUI scanlines. Ordinary
playback keeps its original path. Hardware alpha remains byte-domain GUI
mixing, not exact 12-bit-domain video composition.
Requires the 9911 carrier and 9912 normal output lifecycle patches.
---

